r line.\n\nNext, please try sending an MMS message again. If you still experience issues, let me know, and I will guide you through additional troubleshooting steps.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":12,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:12.676352","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":12,"usage":{"completion_tokens":68,"prompt_tokens":6986}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":13,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:13.903958","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_CxDoKrREadZCaVbCT1QkYNza","name":"can_send_mms","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":13,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":2494}},{"content":"Your messaging app cannot send MMS messages.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":14,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:13.904258","tool_call_id":"call_CxDoKrREadZCaVbCT1QkYNza","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":14,"usage":null},{"content":"I just tried, but I still can’t send MMS messages. What should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:14.842387","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":15,"usage":{"completion_tokens":21,"prompt_tokens":2522}},{"content":"Thank you for trying again. Let’s continue troubleshooting. To help identify the issue, please check if you can use mobile data (for example, try browsing a website with Wi-Fi turned off). Also, could you let me know if you see any error messages when trying to send an MMS?\n\nMeanwhile, I’ll guide you through a few steps to check your phone’s settings. First, please check your phone’s network status and confirm the following:\n\n- Is mobile data enabled?\n- What network type is displayed (e.g., 4G, 5G, 3G, or 2G)?\n- Is Data Saver mode on?\n- Is Airplane Mode off?\n\nLet me know what you see, or if you need instructions on how to check these settings.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":16,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:17.680414","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":16,"usage":{"completion_tokens":158,"prompt_tokens":7079}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:18.512427","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_dM9BuhZ3W4ZHPLQtVvc8M79U","name":"check_status_bar","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":17,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2705}},{"content":"Status Bar: 📶¹ Poor | 2G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:18.512825","tool_call_id":"call_dM9BuhZ3W4ZHPLQtVvc8M79U","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":18,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:19.637482","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_JnyTJks8LNcX1odGMcFtxWGS","name":"check_data_restriction_status","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":19,"usage":{"completion_tokens":15,"prompt_tokens":2745}},{"content":"Data Saver mode is OFF.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:19.637805","tool_call_id":"call_JnyTJks8LNcX1odGMcFtxWGS","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":20,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":21,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:20.457425","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_gXaZIsiKBAHBa9R1tMicTmcn","name":"check_network_status","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":21,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2775}},{"content":"Airplane Mode: OFF\nSIM Card Status: active\nCellular Connection: connected\nCellular Signal: poor\nCellular Network Type: 2G\nMobile Data Enabled: Yes\nData Roaming Enabled: No\nWi-Fi Radio: OFF\nWi-Fi Connected: No","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":22,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:20.457816","tool_call_id":"call_gXaZIsiKBAHBa9R1tMicTmcn","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":22,"usage":null},{"content":"Here’s what I see on my phone:\n\n- Mobile data is enabled.\n- The network type is 2G, and the signal is poor.\n- Data Saver mode is off.\n- Airplane Mode is off.\n- Wi-Fi is off.\n\nI haven’t seen any specific error messages when trying to send an MMS—it just fails to send. What should I try next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":23,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:21.787811","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":23,"usage":{"completion_tokens":78,"prompt_tokens":2850}},{"content":"Thank you for the details. MMS requires at least a 3G network connection—2G is generally not sufficient for sending or receiving MMS messages. \n\nPlease change your phone’s network mode to prefer 4G or 5G (if available). Look for a setting called “Network Mode” or “Preferred Network Type” in your phone’s mobile network settings, and select an option like “4G/5G preferred” or “LTE/5G/4G/3G auto.”\n\nAfter changing the network mode, wait a moment for your phone to connect to a stronger network, then try sending an MMS again.\n\nLet me know if you need step-by-step instructions for changing your network mode, or if the issue persists after making this change.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":24,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:24.041883","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":24,"usage":{"completion_tokens":155,"prompt_tokens":7319}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":25,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:25.178800","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{"mode":"4g_5g_preferred"},"id":"call_gIlkoXwKviAObo4bJ9lSCSF3","name":"set_network_mode_preference","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":25,"usage":{"completion_tokens":24,"prompt_tokens":3087}},{"content":"Preferred Network Mode set to: 4g_5g_preferred\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":26,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:25.179166","tool_call_id":"call_gIlkoXwKviAObo4bJ9lSCSF3","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":26,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":27,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:26.186473","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_r9hE562G4AOwj2ST23uicO5x","name":"can_send_mms","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":27,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3158}},{"content":"Your messaging app cannot send MMS messages.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":28,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:26.186953","tool_call_id":"call_r9hE562G4AOwj2ST23uicO5x","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":28,"usage":null},{"content":"I changed my network mode to prefer 4G/5G, and now I see 5G with excellent signal strength on my status bar. However, I still can’t send MMS messages—it’s still not working. What else can I try?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":29,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:27.539559","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":29,"usage":{"completion_tokens":53,"prompt_tokens":3186}},{"content":"Thank you for updating your network mode and confirming you now have a strong 5G signal. The next step is to check your phone’s APN (Access Point Name) settings, as incorrect APN or missing MMSC URL can prevent MMS from working.\n\nPlease check your APN settings and let me know if you see an MMSC (Multimedia Messaging Service Center) URL listed. If you’re unsure how to check, I can guide you through the process or recommend resetting your APN settings to default, which often resolves MMS issues.\n\nWould you like instructions to check your APN settings, or would you prefer to reset them to default? After resetting, you’ll need to reboot your device for the changes to take effect. Let me know how you’d like to proceed.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":30,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:30.390966","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":30,"usage":{"completion_tokens":159,"prompt_tokens":7531}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":31,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:31.515562","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_W2HNYESWJTc2UlhMInTXeJYa","name":"check_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":31,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3402}},{"content":"Current APN Name: internet\nMMSC URL (for picture messages): http://mms.carrier.com/mms/wapenc\n(These are technical settings, usually best left unchanged.)","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":32,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:31.515998","tool_call_id":"call_W2HNYESWJTc2UlhMInTXeJYa","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":32,"usage":null},{"content":"I checked my APN settings, and I do see an MMSC URL listed: http://mms.carrier.com/mms/wapenc. Should I still try resetting the APN settings to default and rebooting, or is there something else I should check first?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":33,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:32.746592","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":33,"usage":{"completion_tokens":57,"prompt_tokens":3461}},{"content":"Since your APN settings include an MMSC URL, the next thing to check is whether Wi-Fi Calling is enabled, as this can sometimes interfere with MMS. \n\nPlease check if Wi-Fi Calling is turned on in your phone’s settings. If it is enabled, try turning it off and then attempt to send an MMS again.\n\nIf Wi-Fi Calling is already off or turning it off does not resolve the issue, the next recommended step would be to reset your APN settings to default and then reboot your device.\n\nLet me know the status of Wi-Fi Calling, and if needed, I’ll guide you through resetting your APN settings and rebooting your phone.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":34,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:34.697526","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":34,"usage":{"completion_tokens":135,"prompt_tokens":7751}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":35,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:35.871048","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_RgXctfe3GsgDtRPoN5AJICG1","name":"check_wifi_calling_status","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":35,"usage":{"completion_tokens":14,"prompt_tokens":3657}},{"content":"Wi-Fi Calling is currently turned OFF.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":36,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:35.871456","tool_call_id":"call_RgXctfe3GsgDtRPoN5AJICG1","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":36,"usage":null},{"content":"Wi-Fi Calling is currently turned off on my phone. Should I go ahead and reset my APN settings to default and reboot, or is there anything else you’d like me to try first?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":37,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:29:36.988413","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":37,"usage":{"completion_tokens":41,"prompt_tokens":3687}},{"content":"Since Wi-Fi Calling is already off and you’re still unable to send MMS, the next best step is to reset your APN settings to default and then reboot your device. This often resolves persistent MMS issues, even if the current settings appear correct.\n\nPlease proceed with the following steps:\n1. Reset your APN settings to default.\n2. Reboot your device after the reset.\n\nOnce your phone res